&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href="https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f" target="_blank"&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href="https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51" target="_blank"&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href="https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c" target="_blank"&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href="https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f" target="_blank"&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href="https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91" target="_blank"&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0"&gt;We are looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW3980620 BCX0" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0"&gt;Staff System Architect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0"&gt;be fully dedicated to the SNSPD product line, with a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0"&gt;strong focus on leading the technical architecture and roadmap for our next-generation rack-mountable SNSPD (Superconducting Nanowire Single-Photon Detector) platform. This role is critical to defining and guiding the technical evolution of our cutting-edge cryogenic photon detection systems, ensuring architectural coherence across hardware, software, and integration domains while supporting our product vision and market requirements.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW243108471 BCX0" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243108471 BCX0"&gt;What you'll be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW243108471 BCX0" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243108471 BCX0"&gt;In this role, you will be an integral part of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243108471 BCX0"&gt;development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243108471 BCX0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;process for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243108471 BCX0"&gt;IDQ’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243108471 BCX0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;SNSPD platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243108471 BCX0"&gt;, with applications across quantum computing, networking, and sensing. You will&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243108471 BCX0"&gt;be at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243108471 BCX0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;the intersection of quantum photonics, cryogenic systems engineering and embedded systems to create scalable, maintainable architectures for autonomous 24/7 detector operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW243108471 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="0" data-end="568"&gt;You will take ownership of the end-to-end system architecture of the SNSPD platform, ensuring alignment with a shared long-term product vision while translating product requirements into clear system-level designs and specifications. This includes defining system structure, interfaces, and key architectural decisions, as well as driving critical trade-offs across performance, cost, scalability, and integration. You will also align engineering execution with the architectural vision, guiding system integration and resolving complex cross-domain design challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="570" data-end="800"&gt;In addition, you will play a key role in shaping the technology roadmap and driving the evolution of the platform, continuously evaluating and introducing new technologies where relevant to maintain innovation and competitiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start="802" data-end="1040" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1npjt9i" data-start="802" data-end="936"&gt;Lead system architecture, design decisions, and cross-functional alignment to ensure a scalable and high-performing SNSPD platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="sblwzn" data-start="937" data-end="1040" data-is-last-node=""&gt;Drive technology roadmap, integration, and innovation by evaluating and implementing new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;What you'll bring&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="0" data-end="514"&gt;We are seeking a highly experienced professional with a Master’s degree in physics, electrical engineering, photonics, or a related field, and over seven years of experience in system architecture or complex system design. The ideal candidate will bring expertise in multi-domain systems, including photonics, cryogenics, electronics, and embedded or software components, combined with strong system-level thinking and proven experience in integrating complex technologies into cohesive, high-performing solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="516" data-end="870"&gt;You will demonstrate strong technical leadership across multidisciplinary teams, with the ability to clearly communicate complex system architectures to a wide range of stakeholders. This includes ensuring alignment, supporting informed decision-making, and driving successful collaboration across functions to deliver robust and scalable system designs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start="872" data-end="1109" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="o4b5ew" data-start="872" data-end="983"&gt;Extensive experience in system architecture and multi-domain integration, with strong system-level thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1jz7piz" data-start="984" data-end="1109" data-is-last-node=""&gt;Proven technical leadership and communication skills, enabling alignment and effective decision-making across diverse teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;You'll be a great fit with&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="5" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;PhD in a relevant field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="5" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;10+ years in senior technical or architectural roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="5" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;Experience with SNSPDs, cryogenic, or quantum systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="5" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;Experience with industrialized or rack-mountable systems&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:forward-deployed-engineer-lond:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;C3 AI (NYSE: AI), is the Enterprise AI application software company. C3 AI delivers a family of fully integrated products including the C3 Agentic AI Platform, an end-to-end platform for developing, deploying, and operating enterprise AI applications, C3 AI applications, a portfolio of industry-specific SaaS enterprise AI applications that enable the digital transformation of organizations globally, and C3 Generative AI, a suite of domain-specific generative AI offerings for the enterprise.&amp;nbsp;Learn more at: &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://c3.ai/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;C3 AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="s7"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;C3 AI is seeking&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forward Deployed Engineers&lt;/strong&gt;. As a Forward Deployed Engineer, you will be engineering full-stack AI-driven web applications on the C3 AI Platform, working directly with customers to design, develop, and deploy production applications, demos, and proofs-of-technology. An ideal candidate possesses strategic and analytical aptitude, software development expertise, and excellent interpersonal skills.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul data-editing-info="{&amp;quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;unorderedStyleType&amp;quot;:1}"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop and deploy applications.&amp;nbsp;Engineer full-stack, AI-based enterprise applications on the C3 AI Platform.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Mentor junior team members.&amp;nbsp;Share coding standards and design techniques with less experienced engineers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Conduct design and code reviews.&amp;nbsp;Review customer software applications for quality, architecture, and best practices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Test and enhance customer applications.&amp;nbsp;Troubleshoot, test, and improve customer software applications directly and on behalf of customers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Deliver technical enablement.&amp;nbsp;Lead technical deep-dives, product demonstrations, and customer training sessions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Write documentation.&amp;nbsp;Produce application specifications, technical documentation, and supporting artifacts.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Identify and mitigate risk.&amp;nbsp;Continuously surface technical risks and gaps; devise mitigation strategies in anticipation of customer needs.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive product improvement.&amp;nbsp;Work closely with product management and engineering to improve the overall quality of C3 AI software.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul data-editing-info="{&amp;quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;unorderedStyleType&amp;quot;:1}"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Science, Technology, Engineering, or Mathematics (STEM), or a comparable area of study.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;2+ years of professional software development experience with object-oriented programming languages.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills; ability to work effectively on a cross-functional team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Analytical and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Organizational skills and attention to detail.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to travel as needed.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul data-editing-info="{&amp;quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;unorderedStyleType&amp;quot;:1}"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Graduate degree in Science, Technology, Engineering, or Mathematics (STEM), or a comparable area of study.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience deploying enterprise-scale applications.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience working in a customer-facing role.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Software development experience with JavaScript and Python.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with Git or other version control software.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience working with JavaScript frameworks such as React, Redux, Vue, Backbone, or Angular.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C3 AI provides excellent benefits, a competitive compensation package and generous equity plan.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;C3 AI is proud to be an Equal Opportunity and Affirmative Action Employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of any legally protected characteristics, including disabled and veteran status.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:front-end-engineer-manchester-:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP's AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href="wppmedia.com"&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;3058 - Manager, Front-end Engineer - Manchester&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Code, we design and build digital products and platforms for a range of clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Front-end Engineer with strong browser-side engineering skills who cares about how interfaces work in practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work mainly in TypeScript and React, building responsive, accessible and performant interfaces as part of a multidisciplinary product team. We use application frameworks including React Router and Next.js, but strong foundations in HTML, CSS and JavaScript matter just as much.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior engineering role, so you’ll do more than implement designs. You’ll help shape how interfaces are built, work closely with designers on interaction and behaviour, contribute to technical decisions, and help other engineers improve their front-end skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also contribute to how we approach front-end engineering across Code, sharing what works and challenging approaches when there’s a better way to do things.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build high-quality user interfaces using TypeScript, React, HTML and CSS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with React Router, Next.js and similar React application frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with designers to turn ideas and designs into usable, responsive interfaces rather than simply reproducing static screens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make accessibility part of the way software is designed and built, not something added at the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pay close attention to browser performance, loading behaviour and the experience across different devices and connection speeds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape component architecture and contribute to reusable design systems and shared patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write automated tests at the right level, from component and interaction tests through to browser-based end-to-end testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review code, talk through approaches and help less experienced engineers develop their skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside other engineers to understand APIs, application behaviour and how the front end fits into the wider platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the front-end engineering community at Code, sharing ideas and helping us improve how we build for the web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Highly competent across core front-end skillsets: HTML, CSS/SCSS, JavaScript (Vanilla) etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:436}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have good experience building production web applications and strong browser fundamentals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HTML, CSS and JavaScript matter to us. You should understand how browsers work and be able to build interfaces that are responsive, accessible and robust without relying on a framework to solve everything.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also need solid TypeScript and React experience, with experience working in applications built with React Router, Next.js or similar approaches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accessibility should be familiar territory. You should understand semantic HTML, keyboard interaction, focus management and the practical application of WCAG when building interfaces. You should also have experience testing interfaces with screen readers and understand how common interaction patterns are experienced by people using assistive technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Performance matters too. You should be able to investigate and improve things such as loading, rendering, JavaScript execution, images and Core Web Vitals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll need experience with automated testing. The exact tools are less important than knowing what to test and why, but you may have worked with tools such as Vitest, Jest, React Testing Library, Playwright or Cypress.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working well with designers is important. That means understanding the intent behind a design, talking through interaction and responsive behaviour, spotting problems and contributing to the solution rather than waiting for every detail to be specified.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with design systems, Storybook, design tokens or shared component libraries is useful, particularly if you’ve helped establish patterns rather than simply consumed them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior engineer, you’ll also be expected to support others. You don’t need to have formally managed people, but you should be able to review work, share what you know and help other engineers develop.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t expect you to match every technology we use. We’re more interested in strong front-end fundamentals, good engineering judgement and a genuine interest in building accessible, well-crafted web interfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we're together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That's why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink"&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
